      <main id="content"><h1>Declaration-by-declaration textbook coverage</h1><p>4563 production declarations: 526 have newly authored complete teaching units; 1046 are audited data constructions with field-by-field explanations, not mathematical proofs; 16 are unresolved data constructions; 63 have existing notes not certified as complete textbook proofs; 2912 still need a complete exposition. This is documentation coverage, not Lean completion. The requested full-library teaching expansion is unfinished.</p><p>Source records and definitions require explanations of their meaning, not fictitious proofs. A compiled proposition definition is not a proof of that proposition. <a href="../data-readers/index.html">Read the separate data-construction audit.</a></p><label>Find a declaration <input data-table-search="exposition-table" placeholder="Name or module"></label><table id="exposition-table"><thead><tr><th>Declaration</th><th>Kind</th><th>Teaching coverage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-search="autosamplingtheory.automationstage inductive needed"><td><a href="../modules/autosamplingtheory-automation.html#decl-autosamplingtheory-automationstage-30dbab439a"><code>AutoSamplingTheory.AutomationStage</code></a></td><td>inductive</td><td>needed</td></tr><tr data-search="autosamplingtheory.taskkind inductive needed"><td><a href="../modules/autosamplingtheory-automation.html#decl-autosamplingtheory-taskkind-f254032d7b"><code>AutoSamplingTheory.TaskKind</code></a></td><td>inductive</td><td>needed</td></tr><tr data-search="autosamplingtheory.taskstatus inductive needed"><td><a href="../modules/autosamplingtheory-automation.html#decl-autosamplingtheory-taskstatus-dd2b77c516"><code>AutoSamplingTheory.TaskStatus</code></a></td><td>inductive</td><td>needed</td></tr><tr data-search="autosamplingtheory.agentrole inductive needed"><td><a href="../modules/autosamplingtheory-automation.html#decl-autosamplingtheory-agentrole-caf78e6489"><code>AutoSamplingTheory.AgentRole</code></a></t